	<ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock id='F40' contextRef='C1'>5. The pipeline facilities associated with the Risberg Line Project under Docket Number CP18-6-000 were authorized to be placed in service by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission on November 11, 2019.  A delegated Order authorizing the pipeline facilities to be placed into service was filed under Docket CP18-6-000 Accession Number 20191122-3031.</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantLeaseholdsThatHaveBeenAcquiredOrGivenAssignedOrSurrenderedTextBlock>
	<ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock id='F41' contextRef='C1'>6. None</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantExtensionOrReductionOfTransmissionOrDistributionSystemTextBlock>
