	<ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id='F44' contextRef='C1'>9. In reference to the previously disclosed litigation involving Wood Group USA and RH energytrans, LLC.  This matter has now been settled.</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
	<ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock id='F45' contextRef='C1'>10. N/A</ferc:DisclosureOfStatusOfAnyMateriallyImportantLegalProceedingsTextBlock>
