	<ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id='F48' contextRef='C1'>13. Construction for the Risberg Line was funded through an intercompany loan program of approximately $74.8M with OPATHO Gas Trans, LLC.  Respondent intends to review the capital structure yearly and, if necessary, receive an equity infusion from its parent company in order to achieve targeted proprietary ratios.</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
